sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Operator
    participant UI as TradeSync Cockpit
    participant PG as Approval ledger
    participant G as ChaseOS Gate
    participant R as Risk Guardian
    participant S as Isolated signer
    participant H as Hyperliquid

    UI->>PG: Store immutable preview and digest
    UI->>G: Request decision-scoped approval
    G-->>PG: Approve / deny / expire
    U->>UI: Confirm exact preview when required
    UI->>PG: Consume approval exactly once
    PG->>R: Final market, account, and policy check
    alt any check fails
        R-->>UI: Block with reason
    else all checks pass
        R->>S: Bounded order intent and digest
        S->>H: Sign and submit
        H-->>PG: Venue receipt / fill updates
        PG-->>UI: Reconciled status
    end
